# Ultimate Spider-Man: "Whenever you attack, double the number of each kind of counter on each Spider and legendary creature you control." A
# Spider need not be legendary: Bot1's Giant Spider (a 2/4 Creature - Spider) gets one counter from Miles Morales's enters trigger (Miles
# targets only it - "up to two" lets him pick fewer) and so is a 3/5. Miles transforms (Black Lotus's three, Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire)
# into an Ultimate Spider-Man with no counters, who attacks alone with haste: the Spider's one counter becomes two, a 4/6 that did not
# attack, while the Ultimate Spider-Man, with none to double, is still a 4/3 and Bot2 takes 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Giant Spider
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Miles Morales
Mox Sapphire
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

